## Interface: 16001
## Title: ZugDAQ
## Notes: The in-game half of the ZugDAQ app: tracks your gold, auctions, farming, bags and recipes for the app, shows the app's prices, plans and deals in game, and finds the cheapest way to level your professions.
## Author: Troyzerk
## Version: 2.6.2
## AddonCompartmentFunc: ZugDAQ_OnAddonCompartmentClick
## SavedVariables: ZugDAQDB, ZugDAQ_ProfDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ZugDAQ_ProfCharDB
## OptionalDeps: Auctionator, GoldLedger, ProfessionGuide
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Coin_02

